{"4494770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Digital Anima: Virtual Lifeform Care Kit", "steam_appid": 4494770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind an adorable desktop pet lies the despair and madness of a genius programmer.Past your browser, the line between your reality and the internet starts to thin. A desktop virtual pet that slowly turns to horror.Estimated playtime: 4–5 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise a Digima, a digital pet that lives on your PC, and dig into the secrets buried inside it. A missing developer, an incident that engulfs society, a conspiracy... What is the truth waiting at the end of evolution?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*The demo version is approximately 15 minutes long. Please note that save data cannot be transferred to the full version.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ A Story That Grows With Your Digima</strong><br>Launch the Digima window on your PC and start raising your Digima. Feed it, clean up after it, talk to it. That's how it grows.As your Digima grows, it picks up more and more knowledge. When it asks questions, answer them. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4494770/extras/f87b440f96f929438c8b3b9a57a8373c.poster.avif?t=1782183213\" width=700 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4494770/extras/f87b440f96f929438c8b3b9a57a8373c.webm?t=1782183213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4494770/extras/f87b440f96f929438c8b3b9a57a8373c.mp4?t=1782183213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>■ Raising Your Digima </strong><br>There are many ways to evolve your Digima. The right food can trigger it. So can the right keyword. Some of those clues live on an actual, real-world official site, so comb through the web as you raise your Digima.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4494770/extras/b4687c754b70c5fecc1f8328fdc6f9e7.poster.avif?t=1782183213\" width=700 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4494770/extras/b4687c754b70c5fecc1f8328fdc6f9e7.webm?t=1782183213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4494770/extras/b4687c754b70c5fecc1f8328fdc6f9e7.mp4?t=1782183213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>■ An Experience that Crosses into Your Real Web Browser</strong><br>Comb through the Digima manual website, corporate pages, blogs or anywhere else that may prove useful. Unlock hidden pages, search the real web from your own browser and work with your Digima to piece the answers together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4494770/extras/b486fa9cc4395fd9d0c494347a6b3388.poster.avif?t=1782183213\" width=700 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4494770/extras/b486fa9cc4395fd9d0c494347a6b3388.webm?t=1782183213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4494770/extras/b486fa9cc4395fd9d0c494347a6b3388.mp4?t=1782183213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But sometimes evolution takes an unexpected turn, and something shocking may happen...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4494770/extras/2b5534d403b12a8c4bc3ae9d84abeebd.poster.avif?t=1782183213\" width=700 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4494770/extras/2b5534d403b12a8c4bc3ae9d84abeebd.webm?t=1782183213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4494770/extras/2b5534d403b12a8c4bc3ae9d84abeebd.mp4?t=1782183213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Streaming Guidelines</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are genuinely excited to have streams, reviews, opinions and anything else that helps spread the word about the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is fine. Spoilers are fine. Play however you want.Note: While streaming, your desktop, PC name, and the area your PC is in may be displayed on the screen. We recommend that you use OBS's &quot;Display Capture&quot; rather than capturing &quot;multiple windows&quot; when you record or stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*Recommended browsers: Chrome, Edge, Firefox </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠ Do-Not-Stream Sections ⚠</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital Anima: Electronic Life Form Raising Kit contains sections that are not permitted for streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・It is prohibited to set the data analysis rate to 100% after completing the Pokédex. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Permitted Uses&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you own the game, you're welcome to create video content using in-game material.That goes for individuals and companies alike, commercial or non-commercial, as long as you follow the guidelines.If your content contains spoilers, please flag them clearly (e.g. &quot;Spoilers&quot;) so other players aren't caught off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Terms of Use&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please include the following link and credit text below